   "idx": 4,
   "zh": "30多年前，亚太经合组织应运而生，开启了建设亚太共同体的壮阔历程。30多年来，亚太地区面貌日新月异，创造了经济快速发展的“亚太奇迹”。",
   "en": "The launch of APEC more than 30 years ago started a remarkable journey toward building an Asia-Pacific community. Over three decades and more, our region has witnessed progress with each passing day, and created the Asia-Pacific miracle of rapid economic growth.",
   "kind": "para",
   "zp": [
