  {
   "idx": 5,
   "zh": "当前，世界百年变局加速演进，科技创新和产业创新方兴未艾。面对新的机遇和挑战，亚太合作必须适应新形势、迈出新步伐、开创新局面，推动建设和衷共济、开放融通、开拓创新、包容发展的亚太共同体。",
   "en": "Today, momentous changes not seen in a century are accelerating across the globe. Innovation is burgeoning across sciences, technologies and industries. In the face of new opportunities and challenges, we must adapt to the new realities, take new strides, and open up new prospects for Asia-Pacific cooperation. Together, we must strive to build an Asia-Pacific community characterized by solidarity and mutual assistance, openness and integration, enterprise and innovation, as well as inclusive development.",
