   "idx": 6,
   "zh": "——建设亚太共同体，要坚持和衷共济。浩瀚的太平洋承载千帆、滋养万物，造就了亚太地区兼收并蓄、和合共生的磅礴气象。亚太大家庭的成员同在一条船上，要经受住太平洋的风浪，就应当勠力同心、守望相助，拉紧共同利益纽带，携手应对困难和挑战，持续培育共同体意识。",
   "en": "—Building an Asia-Pacific community requires solidarity and mutual assistance. The vast Pacific Ocean, which carries thousands of ships and nurtures all life, has shaped the all-embracing character of the Asia-Pacific region—one defined by inclusiveness and harmonious coexistence. Members of APEC are like passengers riding the same ship. To navigate the waves of the Pacific, we must unite as one and look out for each other. We must expand our shared interests, meet the difficulties and challenges together, and steadily build a shared sense of community.",
   "kind": "para",
   "zp": [
    22,
    22
   ],
   "ep": [
    23,
    23
   ]
  },
  {
   "idx": 7,
   "zh": "——建设亚太共同体，要坚持开放融通。开放合作是亚太发展振兴的必由之路。要秉持开放的区域主义，稳步推进经济一体化进程，构建开放而不排他、融合而不分割的合作格局。倡导自由开放的贸易和投资，打通要素流动堵点，畅通经济循环经脉，为亚太经济增长开拓更广阔空间。",
   "en": "—Building an Asia-Pacific community requires openness and integration. Open cooperation is a sure path to the development and revitalization of the Asia-Pacific. We should uphold open regionalism, steadily advance economic integration and develop a cooperation pattern that is open and integrated, rather than exclusive or fragmented. We should champion free and open trade and investment, remove impediments to the flow of factors, ensure the smooth circulation of economic lifeblood, and open up more space for economic growth in the Asia-Pacific.",
   "kind": "para",
   "zp": [
    25,
    25
   ],
   "ep": [
    26,
    26
   ]
  },
  {
   "idx": 8,
   "zh": "——建设亚太共同体，要坚持开拓创新。创新是引领发展的第一动力。要鼓励科技交流合作，促进创新成果转化，营造开放、公平、公正、非歧视的合作环境。发扬进取精神，放大亚太经合组织孵化器作用，推动机制理念创新和结构性改革，不断释放亚太经济的活力和潜力。",
   "en": "—Building an Asia-Pacific community requires enterprise and innovation. Innovation is the primary driving force of development. It is vital to encourage scientific and technological exchanges and cooperation, facilitate the commercialization of innovation outcomes, and foster an open, fair, just and nondiscriminatory environment for cooperation. We need to carry forward our enterprising spirit, enhance APEC’s role as an incubator to encourage innovation in institutions and ideas as well as structural reform, and further unleash the economic dynamism and potential of our region.",
   "kind": "para",
   "zp": [
