   "zh": "中国是亚太经济合作的倡导者、推动者、先行者。中方愿同各方一道，集思广益、汇聚合力，携手搭建亚太共同体的“四梁八柱”。",
   "en": "China is an advocate, promoter and forerunner of Asia-Pacific economic cooperation. We would like to work with all parties to pool wisdom and synergy in building the four key pillars of an Asia-Pacific community.",
