   "idx": 12,
   "zh": "强化经贸支柱。亚太自由贸易区是亚太经合组织成员的共同愿景，要稳步向前推进，打造更高水平的开放格局。要推动区域经贸协定对接，提升贸易投资便利化、数字化水平，减少贸易投资壁垒。围绕亚太自贸区加强政策对话，开展经验交流和技术合作，提高各方参与高水平经贸安排的能力。",
   "en": "First, we should strengthen the pillar of economy and trade. The Free Trade Area of the Asia-Pacific (FTAAP) is a shared vision of APEC members. It is important to make steady progress in realizing this vision and setting a higher standard for openness. Efforts should be made to align various regional economic and trade agreements, boost trade and investment facilitation and digitalization, and reduce barriers to trade and investment. It is also important to enhance policy dialogue on the FTAAP, and carry out experience sharing and technical cooperation, to help the parties build capacity for participating in high-standard economic and trade arrangements.",
   "kind": "para",
