   "idx": 13,
   "zh": "第二，升级联通支柱。互联互通是区域经济一体化的纽带。2014年，我们共同制定亚太经合组织互联互通蓝图。今天，区域互联互通迎来新的机遇。要巩固“硬联通”，完善基础设施网络，推动智慧海关、智慧交通建设。增强“软联通”，促进政策和监管协调，深化跨境支付合作，维护产业链供应链稳定畅通。密切“心联通”，便利商旅和人员往来，促进人文交流和民众相知相亲。",
   "en": "Second, we should upgrade the pillar of connectivity. Connectivity is a nexus of regional economic integration. In 2014, we jointly developed the APEC Connectivity Blueprint. Today, there are new opportunities for regional connectivity. We should strengthen physical connectivity by improving the infrastructure network, and developing smart customs and smart transportation. We should deepen institutional connectivity by harmonizing policies and regulations, deepening cooperation on cross-border payment, and keeping industrial and supply chains stable and unimpeded. We should also enhance people-to-people connectivity by facilitating travel for business, tourism and other purposes, and promoting cultural exchanges for better mutual understanding and closer ties among our peoples.",
