   "idx": 14,
   "zh": "第三，打造创新支柱。数字经济和人工智能是创新增长的引擎。要加强数字基础设施建设，完善区域数据治理和协同合作，实现高效、便捷、安全的跨境数据流动。打造开放创新生态，促进人工智能广泛应用，推动产业转型升级、向新发展。",
   "en": "Third, we should foster the pillar of innovation. The digital economy and artificial intelligence (AI) are the engines of innovation-driven growth. We should strengthen digital infrastructure development, improve data governance and collaboration in the region, and achieve efficient, convenient and secure cross-border data flow. We should build an open ecosystem for innovation, encourage the broad application of AI, and promote the innovation-driven transformation and upgrading of industries.",
