   "zh": "第四，夯实发展支柱。面对层出不穷的全球性挑战，要加强能力建设，推动区域能源和粮食安全合作，深化跨境腐败治理。推动资源、环境、人口协调发展，加大自然资源合理利用和保护，拓展绿色低碳合作，实现经济可持续增长。支持改善民生和投资于人，实施健康老龄化行动，促进就业和职业技能开发，支持妇女经济赋权和青年人才交流，释放亚太人才活力。",
   "en": "Fourth, we should enhance the pillar of development. To respond to constantly emerging global challenges, we should strengthen capacity building, promote regional cooperation on energy and food security, and deepen anti-corruption governance across borders. We should coordinate the development of resources, the environment and population, scale up the rational utilization and protection of natural resources, and expand green and low-carbon cooperation to achieve sustainable economic growth. We should support livelihood improvements and invest in the people, launch healthy aging programs, facilitate employment and the development of vocational skills, and support women’s economic empowerment and young talent exchanges to tap into the full potential of talent across the Asia-Pacific.",
